Package: mantle
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: linus project <linus@example.com>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libayatana-appindicator3-1, pipewire, wireplumber, network-manager, upower, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr
Description: mantle Wayland shell (fallback package)
 A Tauri 2 / React-based Wayland compositor shell, assembled via the
 dpkg-deb fallback path because the Tauri bundle was absent or unusable at
 packaging time. Binary-only; icons and additional assets may be missing.
